OL,3,GNEWSAGirl punched four times in head by
OL,4,Awoman - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman punched a child in the head
OL,7,Ffour times after throwing a drink
OL,8,Fbottle at her, police say.
OL,10,FGloucestershire Constabulary said a
OL,11,F15-year-old was sitting in Kings Square
OL,12,Fin Gloucester as she saw two women, who
OL,13,Fhad just left The Regal pub with a man,
OL,14,Ffilming themselves on a phone.
OL,16,FThe force said one of the women told
OL,17,Fthe girl to stop looking at them,
OL,18,Fbefore throwing a hard, plastic ball
OL,19,Fcontaining a drink at her face. She
OL,20,Fthen walked off and returned a few
OL,21,Fminutes later to grab the teenager by
OL,22,Fthe hair and punch her, police said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
