OL,3,GNEWSAGirl punched four times in head by
OL,4,Awoman - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have now released a CCTV image
OL,7,Fof a woman who they would like to speak
OL,8,Fto in connection with the incident,
OL,9,Fwhich happened at about 14:20 BST on 3
OL,10,FSeptember.
